    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the ibuprofen reduces inflammation in my stomach?? i thought it did the opposite for people with ulcers. also, if i'm already taking a PPI for my stomach, is it safe to just keep adding more pills like this to get the headache gone? i'm getting a bit worried about mixing everything up.",
